OL,3,GNEWSAFoster carer posthumously awarded 
OL,4,Afreedom of city                        
OL,6,FA foster carer who supported mothers   
OL,7,Fand babies in Brighton and Hove has    
OL,8,Fbeen posthumously honoured with the    
OL,9,Ffreedom of the city.                   
OL,11,FAllison Fackrell, who also served as a 
OL,12,Fmagistrate, died before she could      
OL,13,Freceive the award at a ceremony in Hove
OL,14,FTown Hall on Thursday, according to the
OL,15,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service      
OL,16,F(LDRS).                                
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
