OL,3,GNEWSAFoster carer posthumously awarded 
OL,4,Afreedom of city                        
OL,6,FBrighton & Hove City Council leader    
OL,7,FBella Sankey said: "Freedom of the city
OL,8,Frecognises people of distinction and   
OL,9,Fthose who have rendered eminent service
OL,10,Fto our city. Allison unquestionably did
OL,11,Fthat."                                 
OL,13,FCallum Chapman, Fackrell's son,        
OL,14,Fcollected the honour on her behalf. "My
OL,15,Fmum really burned the candle at both   
OL,16,Fends, but she never rushed anyone," he 
OL,17,Fsaid.                                  
